# The brand source drops in at the repo root; the committed asset is the copy
# at web/public/brand/holdfast-logo.png. Ignoring the root file keeps one of
# them authoritative.
/Logo.png

# Agent worktrees — full repo copies, each runs its own gates against its own root.
.claude/

# The eval report is generated, never committed. A placeholder in git would seed
# audit:claims with fake numbers, and every agent running the harness would dirty its
# branch with an out-of-scope file.
eval/report.json
eval/report.prev.json
